[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Independent publication metadata admission

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: ARTIFACT-METADATA-ADMISSION-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Every publication metadata field is necessary
STATEMENT: >>>
Publication shall require complete=true, status=succeeded and schema_version=1
independently. A failed field shall return InvalidInput before creating the
destination root or any partial published files. Valid fields shall not excuse
another failed field.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: artifact.rs publish metadata preflight.
Verification: storage_power publication_metadata_fields_are_independently_required_before_storage
tests all seven invalid combinations; artifact_roundtrip_collision_and_corruption
retains the valid positive control. This requirement does not establish crash-proof
or adversarial filesystem durability.
<<<
